30	About M.Tech	M.Tech (Master of Technology) is a postgraduate engineering programme designed for deep specialisation in a chosen area. It focuses on advanced concepts, laboratory work, tools and strong project/research output. The biggest differentiator in M.Tech is your dissertation/project work — it becomes your portfolio and often decides your placement and long-term career direction.	The biggest differentiator in M.Tech is your dissertation/project work — it becomes your portfolio and often decides your placement and long-term career direction.	[\n        {"key":"Degree type","value":"Postgraduate Engineering Degree"},\n        {"key":"Duration","value":"2 Years"},\n        {"key":"Eligibility","value":"B.Tech/B.E (relevant branch)"},\n        {"key":"Entry","value":"GATE / institute entrance (as applicable)"},\n        {"key":"Best for","value":"Specialisation • R&D • senior roles • teaching track"}\n    ]	[]	\N	\N	[]	[]	[]	30	t	2026-07-23 18:54:39	2026-07-23 18:55:55	30	66	67	70	courses/mtech	[]	[]	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[{"icon": "FlaskConical", "title": "R&D / Product Companies", "description": "Core engineering R&D, advanced product roles, research and development teams."}, {"icon": "Cpu", "title": "IT / Software (for CS and domain-shifters)", "description": "Backend, systems, AI/ML, security, data engineering (depends on skill + projects)."}, {"icon": "Factory", "title": "Core Industries", "description": "Power, manufacturing, automotive, construction, telecom—higher technical roles."}, {"icon": "GraduationCap", "title": "Academics / Training (as per norms)", "description": "Teaching/research assistant roles, labs, institutions (depends on eligibility rules)."}]	["Pick M.Tech specialisation based on your target job role, not just branch name.", "Your dissertation/project should match the kind of job you want after M.Tech.", "Choose institutes with strong labs, research culture and real placement outcomes."]	["UG marksheets + degree/provisional certificate", "GATE scorecard / entrance score (if applicable)", "ID proof (Aadhaar etc.)", "Photo + signature", "Category/EWS/Income certificate (if applicable)", "Domicile (if required)"]	["Choose a niche and build deep expertise (avoid being generalist at PG level)", "Strong major project/dissertation with real problem statement", "Research reading habit (papers, standards, tools)", "Internships in labs/industry if possible", "Strong documentation + presentation skills (reports, papers, demos)"]	[]	["Usually after B.Tech/B.E or equivalent in a relevant branch (rules vary by institute).", "Admission often through GATE and/or institute/state entrance processes.", "Some programmes accept sponsored/working candidates (as per institute norms).", "Branch alignment and minimum marks criteria vary—verify official notifications."]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[{"focus": "Advanced specialisation in a chosen branch with deeper theory, labs and project/research work.", "title": "M.Tech / M.E (Postgraduate Engineering)", "duration": "2 Years"}, {"focus": "A core part of M.Tech—project work defines your niche, portfolio and job readiness.", "title": "Dissertation / Major Project", "duration": "During the programme"}, {"focus": "R&D roles, product engineering, senior technical jobs, academic pathway (as per norms).", "title": "Higher Technical Roles / R&D / Teaching track", "duration": "After M.Tech"}, {"focus": "Research-focused track for innovation, advanced R&D and academic careers.", "title": "PhD / Research (optional)", "duration": "Long-term"}]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[{"desc": "You want advanced knowledge in your branch and higher responsibility roles.", "icon": "ShieldCheck", "title": "For deeper specialisation"}, {"desc": "You want research-oriented roles, innovation projects and technical depth.", "icon": "FlaskConical", "title": "For R&D / product engineering"}, {"desc": "M.Tech strengthens eligibility for academic roles along with required regulation