32	B.Sc Computer Science / IT	B.Sc Computer Science and B.Sc IT are undergraduate science degrees that build strong foundations in programming, computing fundamentals and IT systems. Many universities keep a stronger maths/logic base in B.Sc compared to purely application-focused programmes. Like all tech careers, your outcome depends on skills: projects, internships and interview readiness matter more than marks alone.		[\n        {"key":"Degree type","value":"UG Science Degree (CS/IT)"},\n        {"key":"Duration","value":"3 Years"},\n        {"key":"Eligibility","value":"Class 12 (criteria varies)"},\n        {"key":"Best for","value":"CS fundamentals + tech careers"},\n        {"key":"Strong ladder","value":"B.Sc → M.Sc / MCA → specialisation"}\n    ]	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	32	t	2026-07-23 18:59:29	2026-07-24 00:29:43	30	66	71	73	/courses/bsc-computer-science-it	[]	[]	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[{"icon": "Cpu", "title": "IT Services & Software", "description": "Development, testing, support and IT services roles."}, {"icon": "Briefcase", "title": "Startups / Product Teams", "description": "Developer roles if you have strong projects + interview readiness."}, {"icon": "Database", "title": "Data / Database Teams", "description": "DB support, data ops, reporting and analytics support roles."}, {"icon": "Network", "title": "IT Operations / Networking", "description": "Network/support roles, basic system administration tracks (with skills)."}]	["Choose colleges with strong labs, updated syllabus and practical training.", "Check if they include modern development and internship support.", "Ask about placement support and alumni outcomes for CS/IT roles."]	["Class 10 & 12 marksheets", "ID proof (Aadhaar etc.)", "Photo + signature", "Category/EWS/Income certificate (if applicable)", "Domicile (if required)"]	["Pick one main language (Python/Java/JS) and get strong", "Build 3–5 solid projects (portfolio/GitHub)", "Practice DSA + logic (basic to intermediate)", "In