33	About MCA	MCA (Master of Computer Applications) is a postgraduate programme that prepares graduates for software and IT careers through deeper computer science fundamentals, development skills and project work. MCA becomes powerful when you use it to build a strong portfolio: projects, internships and coding practice are the biggest factors for placements and role quality.	MCA becomes powerful when you use it to build a strong portfolio: projects, internships and coding practice are the biggest factors for placements and role quality.	[\n        {"key":"Degree type","value":"PG Computer Applications Degree"},\n        {"key":"Duration","value":"2 Years (varies by rules)"},\n        {"key":"Eligibility","value":"Bachelor degree (criteria varies)"},\n        {"key":"Best for","value":"Software careers + stronger roles"},\n        {"key":"Reality check","value":"Projects + DSA decide placement"}\n    ]	[]	\N	\N	[]	[]	[]	33	t	2026-07-23 19:00:06	2026-07-23 19:14:16	30	66	71	74	courses/mca	[]	[]	{}	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[]	[{"icon": "Cpu", "title": "IT Services & Software Companies", "description": "Development, testing, support and implementation roles."}, {"icon": "Briefcase", "title": "Product Companies / Startups", "description": "Developer roles if projects + DSA + interviews are strong."}, {"icon": "Database", "title": "Data / Database Teams", "description": "DB, analytics support, reporting, data operations (with skills)."}, {"icon": "Cloud", "title": "Cloud / Platform Teams", "description": "Cloud ops, deployment support, DevOps entry roles (with skills)."}]	["Check if the programme includes updated development stacks and real project work.", "Look for internship/industry exposure and placement outcomes.", "Your final-year project should match the job role you want after MCA."]	["UG marksheets + degree/provisional certificate", "Class 10 & 12 marksheets (for maths eligibility if required)", "Entrance scorecard (if applicable)", "ID proof (Aadhaar et